ng cast member,"}, "final_score": 1.9893164015775593, "relevance_score": 0.9978510505740837, "ground_score": 0.9914653510034757, "utility_score": 0.0, "seq_score": -0.03416453475693158, "relevance_probs": {"[Irrelevant]": 0.0021488299326210296, "[Relevant]": 0.997795564619534}, "support_probs": [{"[Fully supported]": 0.9869591527341832, "[Partially supported]": 0.008341065190128377, "[No support / Contradictory]": 0.004361226952316177}], "utility_probs": [{"[Utility:1]": 0.0007047720996986708, "[Utility:2]": 0.0009520863530973946, "[Utility:3]": 0.00038019602984248316, "[Utility:4]": 0.0036927417681017027, "[Utility:5]": 0.7819869699511743}], "n_tokens": 56}, {"node_id": 3, "parent": 0, "depth": 1, "p_idx": 2, "pred": "[Relevant]Jason Sudeikis plays the role of Cleveland Brown on the Cleveland Show.[Fully supported][Utility:5]</s>", "processed_pred": "[Relevant]Jason Sudeikis plays the role of Cleveland Brown on the Cleveland Show.[Fully supported][Utility:5]</s>", "beam_score": 1.5526983655614877, "ctx": {"title": "Jason Sudeikis", "text": "Jason Sudeikis Daniel Jason Sudeikis ( ; born September 18, 1975) is an American comedian, actor, screenwriter and producer. In the 1990s, he began his career in improv comedy. He has also performed with ComedySportz and The Second City. In 2003, Sudeikis was hired as a sketch writer for \"Saturday Night Live\" and was a cast member from 2005 to 2013. He is best known for his roles in the films \"Horrible Bosses\" (2011), \"Hall Pass\" (2011), \"We're the Millers\" (2013), \"Horrible Bosses 2\" (2014), \"Colossal\" (2016), \"Mother's Day\" (2016) and \"The Angry Birds Movie\" (2016). Daniel Jason Sudeikis was"}, "final_score": 1.5526983655614877, "relevance_score": 0.9367494810966495, "ground_score": 0.6159488844648382, "utility_score": 0.0, "seq_score": -0.47909489178640624, "relevance_probs": {"[Irrelevant]": 0.06323452856454974, "[Relevant]": 0.9365126618288558}, "support_probs": [{"[Fully supported]": 0.5958538503256651, "[P