and 1 member from Mizoram and Arunachal Pradesh and 11 members from 2 states for the Council of States, the Rajya Sabha.[Utility:5]</s>", "processed_pred": "[Relevant]The 2008 Indian Rajya Sabha elections were held on various dates in 2008 to elect members of the Rajya Sabha, Indian Parliament's upper chamber.[No support / Contradictory][Continue to Use Evidence]The elections were held to elect respectively 55 members from 15 states, 4 members from Karnataka and 1 member from Mizoram and Arunachal Pradesh and 11 members from 2 states for the Council of States, the Rajya Sabha.[Utility:5]</s>", "beam_score": 1.0142658055285776, "ctx": {"title": "2008 Indian Rajya Sabha elections", "text": "for the vacant seats from the State of Bihar, Nagaland, West Bengal and Bihar , and West Bengal and Madhya Pradesh. 2008 Indian Rajya Sabha elections Rajya Sabha elections were held on various dates in 2008, to elect members of the Rajya Sabha, Indian Parliament's upper chamber. The elections were held to elect respectively 55 members from 15 states , 4 members from Karnataka and 1 member from Mizoram and Aruncahl Pradesh and 11 members from 2 states for the Council of States, the Rajya Sabha. Elections were held to elect members from various states . The following members are"}, "final_score": 1.0142658055285776, "relevance_score": 0.7648916000611583, "ground_score": 0.2493742054674192, "utility_score": 0.0, "seq_score": -0.09885668426691728, "relevance_probs": {"[Irrelevant]": 0.2350807640484359, "[Relevant]": 0.7648016906387937}, "support_probs": [{"[Fully supported]": 0.22970381725869649, "[Partially supported]": 0.038387355011988485, "[No support / Contradictory]": 0.7299971997731077}], "utility_probs": [{"[Utility:1]": 0.0002696687839325705, "[Utility:2]": 0.0007818384094144511, "[Utility:3]": 0.002484677326516545, "[Utility:4]": 0.007713370893777892, "[Utility:5]": 0.6729730222480833}], "n_tokens": 107}, {"node_id": 5, "parent": 0, "depth": 1, "p_idx": 4, "pred": "[Relevant]